---
title: API Center — SDK TribeClient Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Tribe Service
    participant TC as TribeClient SDK
    participant AX as Axios Instance
    participant GW as API Center Gateway
    participant RD as Redis (Token Store)
    participant UP as Target Service

    rect rgb(26, 26, 46)
    Note over App,UP: Phase 1 — Initialization
    App->>TC: new TribeClient(gatewayUrl, tribeId, secret, sourceServiceId?)
    TC->>AX: Create Axios instance
    TC->>TC: Set defaults: timeout 30s, headers
    end

    rect rgb(15, 52, 96)
    Note over App,UP: Phase 2 — Authentication
    App->>TC: await client.authenticate()
    TC->>AX: POST /api/v1/auth/token
    AX->>GW: { tribeId, secret }
    GW->>GW: Validate credentials
    GW->>RD: Store refresh token (keyed by jti)
    GW-->>AX: { accessToken, refreshToken, expiresIn }
    AX-->>TC: Response
    TC->>TC: Store tokens in memory
    TC->>TC: Set tokenExpiry = now + expiresIn
    end

    rect rgb(22, 33, 62)
    Note over App,UP: Phase 3 — Service Call
    App->>TC: await client.callService('user-svc', '/users/123')
    TC->>TC: ensureAuth() - check tokenExpiry
    alt Token expiring within 30s
        TC->>AX: POST /api/v1/auth/token/refresh
        AX->>GW: { refreshToken }
        GW->>RD: Validate refresh token
        GW-->>AX: New tokens
        AX-->>TC: Apply new tokens
    end
    TC->>AX: GET /api/v1/tribes/user-svc/users/123
    Note over AX: Headers injected automatically
    Note over AX: Authorization: Bearer ...
    Note over AX: X-Tribe-Id: demand-service
    Note over AX: X-Correlation-ID: uuid
    AX->>GW: Forward with headers
    GW->>GW: Full gateway pipeline
    GW->>UP: Proxy to upstream
    UP-->>GW: Response { success, data, meta }
    GW-->>AX: Gateway response
    AX-->>TC: Raw response
    TC->>TC: Unwrap envelope - extract data
    TC-->>App: Return data only
    end

    rect rgb(83, 52, 131)
    Note over App,UP: Phase 4 — Retry on Transient Failure
    App->>TC: await client.callService('pay-svc', '/charge')
    TC->>AX: POST /api/v1/tribes/pay-svc/charge
    AX->>GW: Request
    GW-->>AX: 503 Service Unavailable
    TC->>TC: Attempt 1 failed - retryable
    TC->>TC: Backoff ~500ms with jitter
    TC->>AX: Retry request
    AX->>GW: Request
    GW->>UP: Proxy (circuit half-open)
    UP-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>AX: Success
    AX-->>TC: Response
    TC->>TC: Unwrap envelope
    TC-->>App: Return data
    end

    rect rgb(233, 69, 96)
    Note over App,UP: Phase 5 — Error Handling
    App->>TC: await client.callService('unknown', '/foo')
    TC->>AX: GET /api/v1/tribes/unknown/foo
    AX->>GW: Request
    GW-->>AX: 404 Not Found
    TC->>TC: Not retryable (4xx)
    TC->>TC: Wrap as ServiceNotFoundError
    TC-->>App: throw ServiceNotFoundError
    Note over App: Catch specific error type
    end
